# Naut''Yll Devastator

## Lore

These stormtroopers are the special forces of the naut''yll military. They are skilled, highly intelligent, resourceful and cunning, and they usually possess magic or psionic powers on top of it - only about one Devastator in ten has neither.

## GM Notes

A Devastator who is a mystic, a ley line walker, an ocean wizard, a shifter or a techno-wizard keeps the powers of that class, but takes the military skill list on this page in place of the magic class''s own skills. That is the reverse of how every other borrowed-skills class in this book works, and it is worth reading twice.

Explosives, magic weapons and other special equipment are made available to officers and for special assignments.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'nautyll-devastator');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
